# A LAN session, the Mac hosting (tools/lan/mac_session.py run host):
# main menu -> Multiplayer -> Other Multiplayer -> Host Game "mac-ref" -> the
# room, then the steps appended to the live file (@LIVE@ is replaced by its
# path), one at a time as they arrive: chat, Start Game, the game, quitting.
# Coordinates are tests/lobby/lobby-lan-host.script's (docs/reference/lobby.md §13).
timeout 3600000
pointer f32 [0x9197a8]+4 [0x9197a8]+8
hold 250
wait frames 30
moveby 1 1
wait 300

click 511 371                 # Multiplayer
wait change within 30000
wait 2000
dump won

pointer system
click 618 644                 # Other Multiplayer
wait change within 20000
wait 2000
dump lan

click 774 662                 # Host Game
wait change 0.01 within 20000
wait 1000
click 554 306                 # the Game Name field
wait 500
type mac-ref
wait 500
dump host-dialog
click 448 480                 # Create Game
wait change 0.05 within 20000
wait 3000
dump room                     # Game: mac-ref; the advert goes out on UDP 8585
log hosting mac-ref; following the live file
follow @LIVE@
